# Third-party Claude Code plugin skill files vendored into .claude/skills/ —
# not part of this project's own source; must not be reformatted by our tooling.
.claude/

# Prettier formats code, not prose. Our markdown is hand-written and includes
# records that must not drift: the approved spec, ADRs, and the plans we execute.
# Reformatting them realigns tables for no benefit while mutating approved
# artifacts and burying real edits in whitespace noise.
*.md

# The approved visual-identity mockup: verbatim exports from the design tool,
# and the source of truth ADR-008 points at. They are read as a record of what
# was approved, never executed, so reformatting them would mutate an approved
# artifact to satisfy a linter that has no claim on it.
docs/design/v2-mockup/

# Serena's own project state. It rewrites these files itself, with native line
# endings by design, so Prettier reformatting them would be a standing fight
# between two tools over a file neither of them owns. .gitattributes exempts
# the same path from the repo's eol=lf rule for the same reason.
.serena/
